  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "65bd6e83-b1f6-4d98-bad8-52589369d522",
    "name": "Dacast Analytics Live Channels API",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
    "description": {
      "content": "RESTful JSON API for the Dacast live streaming and video hosting (OTT) platform. Covers live channels, video on demand (VOD), playlists, and viewer analytics. Authentication uses an X-Api-Key request header. API access is gated to Scale and Custom plans (trial accounts can request temporary access from Dacast sales).\nGrounding note: the base host (https://developer.dacast.com), the v2 versioning, X-Api-Key auth, and the operations POST /v2/vod, POST /v2/channel, POST /v2/playlist, and GET /v2/playlist/{playlistId} are confirmed from Dacast's public developer docs (docs.dacast.com). Operations marked \"x-modeled: true\" are honestly modeled REST shapes for capabilities Dacast documents but whose exact paths, verbs, or parameters are not published; verify against the developer portal before use.\n\nContact Support:\n Name: Dacast Support",
      "type": "text/plain"
    }
  }
